{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id275115404"}, "name":{"label":"fmac_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-28T00:01:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8504027776"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing"}, "content":{"label":"A fantastic app, especially with the latest update! I was using apple podcasts until recently, and the raw speed of pausing and playing a podcast is leagues ahead of apple podcasts, which often takes seconds to play on my iPhone 12. Also, there are so many little things it does better, like pausing the podcast when Siri gives you directions. The new UI has some work to be done but looks significantly better than the terrible old UI. A significant update!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id28845709"}, "name":{"label":"RankStranger"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-25T16:54:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8495571407"}, "title":{"label":"Like one of my children, only useful"}, "content":{"label":"The newest update made me wonder if I’ve ever written a review. In case I haven’t, here it is. I’ve been an overcast user from launch day and I use it more that any other app, maybe more than any other thing in my life, except maybe my bed (maybe). I never want it to do anything more than what it does, until a new feature is released, then I wonder how I ever did without that thing. Anywhere else I’ve tried to listen to a podcast feels like visiting a foreign country where everyone hates me. For the price of subscription (or free, if you must) it’s absurdly great value. If podcasts are your thing, I know of no reason why you wouldn’t try it and can’t imagine you not liking it. 5 million stars", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id16948306"}, "name":{"label":"kloptops"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-25T07:38:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8494133104"}, "title":{"label":"Still Amazing!"}, "content":{"label":"Been using this app for 5 years now, best in class. Finally decided to update my old review. \n\nGreat app! Smart speed is an awesome feature that minimises silences in podcasts without chipmunking the audio.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id34148433"}, "name":{"label":"markkemp"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-25T04:55:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8493572956"}, "title":{"label":"Great app but current version not heat with CarPlay"}, "content":{"label":"Have been a fan since the beginning, but CarPlay issues are now a problem (the car is where I use this app the most). Blank playlists in CarPlay and having to open the app on the phone to get things to show up is not a great solution and can be dangerous. Hopefully fixed soon.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id38605315"}, "name":{"label":"benw1989"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-25T00:49:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8492957313"}, "title":{"label":"Great!"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast has been my go-to for iOS podcasting for many, many years now. Marco’s latest update brings the design a little more into the 21st century and great features like smart speed means that Overcast is the only podcasting app for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id424974625"}, "name":{"label":"pja2536"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-24T23:32:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.2"}, "id":{"label":"8492791046"}, "title":{"label":"Still the best!"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried many different podcast players but Overcast remains my favourite.\nIf you are fussy about managing your podcast listening then Overcast will be your friend 🤔🫢😃😆", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id277419314"}, "name":{"label":"Hajahahishau"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-11T05:54:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.1"}, "id":{"label":"8443773554"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty good"}, "content":{"label":"Pretty good app, probably one of the best for podcasts. The search function is very slow though, and often just doesn’t work at all which is disappointing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id116666626"}, "name":{"label":"danlibbo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-07T12:45:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.1"}, "id":{"label":"8431318942"}, "title":{"label":"The fall of the king"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for years and the iOS memory issues, UI quirks and spartan web interface have been balanced by the personalisation options and Shortcuts for a long time. \nI’ve experimented moving to Apple Podcasts, PocketCast, Castro and even Stitcher butI’ve been comfortable with an ‘old friend’s’ eccentricities.  \nThat all changed when I got an Apple Watch. \nMy expectation of playing a podcast from beginning to end while away from my phone seemed simple but is apparently an impossible task. Episodes inexplicably stop and even disappear from the watch, the watch forgets which playlist to sync so it takes 5 minutes to pick another episode.\n4-stars for the iOS app, -2 for Watch +1 for old time’s sake. \nI really hope this app can improve.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id360125429"}, "name":{"label":"Paul Davie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-02T07:48:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.1"}, "id":{"label":"8412813437"}, "title":{"label":"Apple CarPlay Buggy"}, "content":{"label":"I like the app, it’s really unfortunate CarPlay doesn’t always function correctly.  When first opening, it does not load up playlists or anything. You’re required to reopen the app multiple times.  I’ve tried it on multiple cars. \n\nSpotify get around this by having a “loading” screen while it’s all loaded. This would fix this issue.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
